body: "GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1390\nReported version: 2026.10.4\n\nThe report describes receipt-attributable drift routed to history-repair and a reconciled durable receipt treated as pending by another worktree. Reproduce with real shared Git worktrees before modifying the reconciliation contract.\n\nThe complete public issue and its comments were read. This record is intake; the report is not independently reproduced or fixed yet. The completed predecessor pm-baksix remains shipped work and is not represented as an outstanding failure.\n\nAcceptance: Trusted pending receipt overlap routes drift remediation to merge reconcile; Committed reconciled state dominates stale clone-local pending indexes; Repeated reconciliation writes nothing and adds no duplicate audit event; Unrelated drift and malformed evidence remain fail-closed."
